      "writtenOn": "2026-09-23T13:21:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This callback runs a full ask round-trip after onDeviceConnected() and nothing re-checks the state it was scheduled under. If the device disconnects meanwhile, onDeviceDisconnected() unregisters nothing because the mount is not registered yet, and this callback then registers it and writes the device back as connected.",
      "revId": "606725b3ae95595840b2f40b0804a9a17d30bf59",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
