      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-24T12:15:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Added a connection generation counter. It is bumped on connect, disconnect, failure and close, all under the facade lock. The callback checks it under the same lock and skips registration and the connected status update if the connection it was scheduled for has been superseded.",
