      "writtenOn": "2026-09-23T13:21:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Every execution of this line makes NetconfNodeActor:180 create a new NetconfDataTreeServiceActor. Since context().stop(self()) was removed from NetconfDataTreeServiceActor, nothing stops the previous child. They are stopped only when NetconfNodeActor stops, which is once per device lifetime. Please fix NetconfNodeActor to reuse one child instead of creating one per request.",
      "revId": "606725b3ae95595840b2f40b0804a9a17d30bf59",
      "serverId": "7fc14799-209e-464c-9743-7a06c2c21a81"
