      "writtenOn": "2026-09-24T12:15:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "NetconfNodeActor now creates one NetconfDataTreeServiceActor per master session and hands the same ref to every request. The old child is stopped on a new CreateInitialMasterActorData. It now refuses the request with NotMasterException while dataStoreService is still null, so a child without a data store behind it is never cached.",
